          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "The question whether Joseph actually practiced divination, or only pretended to do so, or merely instructed his steward to ask an ironical question; or whether the original words may not have a different interpretation from that which the translators have put upon them, is one wh…",
